"header\" style=\"z-index:999\"><div class=\"left\"><p class=\"logo\"></p><p class=\"line\"></p><div class=\"text\">Design, Create &amp; Play<br/>Discover a new RPG experience with RPGGO</div></div><div class=\"nav\"><a class=\"item \" href=\"https://creator.rpggo.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Create</a><a class=\"item \" href=\"https://developer.rpggo.ai/dev-docs\" target=\"_blank\">Developer</a><a class=\"item current\" href=\"https://rpggo.ai/about-us\" target=\"_blank\">About Us</a></div><div class=\"right\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/xZQHpSxyMT\" target=\"_blank\"><p class=\"icon\"></p><p>Join Community</p></a></div></div><div><h1 class=\"t1 text-center\">Live your adventure in<br/> AI-powered games</h1><p class=\"header_p1__9VK_B\">zero-code game generator for everyone, Open Source on the way</p><p class=\"header_p2__7Tgch\">The developer friendly Multi-modal engine for game, enriching every simple thought into interactive and immersive Role Playing Game.</p><div class=\"header_cover__7TBGc\"><div class=\"header_cover_bg__NEMvR\"><div class=\"header_tag_item__Inq2B\"># AI Character</div><div class=\"header_tag_item__Inq2B\"># AI Game Master</div><div class=\"header_tag_item__Inq2B\"># AI Fantasy</div><div class=\"header_tag_item__Inq2B\"># AI Roleplay</div></div></div><div class=\"header_link__WntLF\"><a href=\"https://www.rpggo.ai/game/GYO8NBGOT\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"header_link_item__iGG99\"><p class=\"d20-black fw-700\">One Step Chat and Create</p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/creativity.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><a href=\"https://creator.rpggo.ai\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"header_link_item__iGG99\"><p class=\"d20-black fw-700\">Unleash your creativity</p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/creativity.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/xZQHpSxyMT\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"header_link_item__iGG99\"><p class=\"d20-black fw-700\">Join community</p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/discord.png\" alt=\"\"/></a></div><a href=\"https://developer.rpggo.ai/dev-docs\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"header_dev_button__NnYBM\">Developer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><mask id=\"path-1-inside-1_80_518\" fill=\"white\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4.25781 1.23608L12 8.11803L4.25781 15V11.9705L8.59181 8.11803L4.25781 4.26559V1.23608Z\"></path></mask><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4.25781 1.23608L12 8.11803L4.25781 15V11.9705L8.59181 8.11803L4.25781 4.26559V1.23608Z\" fill=\"white\"></path><path d=\"M12 8.11803L13.9931 5.8758L16.5156 8.11803L13.9931 10.3603L12 8.11803ZM4.25781 1.23608H1.25781V-5.44445L6.2509 -1.00614L4.25781 1.23608ZM4.25781 15L6.2509 17.2422L1.25781 21.6805V15H4.25781ZM4.25781 11.9705H1.25781V10.6233L2.26472 9.72824L4.25781 11.9705ZM8.59181 8.11803L10.5849 5.8758L13.1074 8.11803L10.5849 10.3603L8.59181 8.11803ZM4.25781 4.26559L2.26472 6.50782L1.25781 5.61279V4.26559H4.25781ZM10.0069 10.3603L2.26472 3.47831L6.2509 -1.00614L13.9931 5.8758L10.0069 10.3603ZM2.26472 12.7577L10.0069 5.8758L13.9931 10.3603L6.2509 17.2422L2.26472 12.7577ZM1.25781 15V11.9705H7.25781V15H1.25781ZM10.5849 10.3603L6.2509 14.2127L2.26472 9.72824L6.59872 5.8758L10.5849 10.3603ZM6.2509 2.02336L10.5849 5.8758L6.59872 10.3603L2.26472 6.50782L6.2509 2.02336ZM1.25781 4.26559V1.23608H7.25781V4.26559H1.25781Z\" fill=\"#1F1F1F\" mask=\"url(#path-1-inside-1_80_518)\"></path></svg></div></a></div></header><main><div><div class=\"product-news_yellowBorder1__m99Hu\"></div><div class=\"product-news_content__3kL9d\"><div class=\"product-news_subtitle__wYyOz\"><h1 class=\"t1\">Product news <br/>and updates</h1><div class=\"product-news_share__f5CEv\"><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/xZQHpSxyMT\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/discord.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/RPGGOAI\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/reddit.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/RPGGOai\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/x.png\" alt=\"\"/></a></div></div><div class=\"product-news_gameList__fGbat\"><a href=\"https://blog.rpggo.ai/2024/09/30/everyone-can-create-a-text-based-rpg-with-generative-ai\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"product-news_gameItem__3WhJw\"><div class=\"product-news_cover__V0b_T\"><img class=\"product-news_c0__1o2iO\" src=\"https://blog.rpggo.ai/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/28007-1sb-nrxmsy4wx6cwv4qtftw.jpeg\" alt=\"\"/></div><p class=\"d16-black font-500 product-news_covertitle__efyb5\">Everyone can Create a Text-Based RPG with Generative AI</p><p class=\"d14-grey\">Create game with no code or zero knowledge</p></div></a><a href=\"https://blog.rpggo.ai/2024/05/17/generate-image-with-ai-new-feature-added-to-rpggo-game-maker/\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"product-news_gameItem__3WhJw\"><div class=\"product-news_cover__V0b_T\"><img src=\"https://blog.rpggo.ai/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/970f2-1242um8tin6i9wxwru-eq0a.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><p class=\"d16-black font-500 product-news_covertitle__efyb5\">Generate Image with AI, New Feature Added to RPGGO Game Maker!</p><p class=\"d14-grey\">3...2...1... and see the magic unfolds</p></div></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzzZ22o54Vc\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"product-news_gameItem__3WhJw\"><div class=\"product-news_cover__V0b_T\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QzzZ22o54Vc/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"product-news_player__1IZqI\"></div></div><p class=\"d16-black font-500 product-news_covertitle__efyb5\">How to Create A RPG on My Own Using AI? Introduction to Creator Tool</p><p class=\"d14-grey\">A walkthrough on how to create AI Text Game</p></div></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TGJNiVnoAfA\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"product-news_gameItem__3WhJw\"><div class=\"product-news_cover__V0b_T\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TGJNiVnoAfA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"product-news_player__1IZqI\"></div></div><p class=\"d16-black font-500 product-news_covertitle__efyb5\">Learn how to use the Goal System in 5 minutes!</p><p class=\"d14-grey\">System upgrade: granular control by AI AutoGM</p></div></a></div></div><div class=\"product-news_greyBorder1___Okg0\"></div></div><div class=\"open-worlds_OpenWorlds__j_sxp\"><div class=\"ai-tool_aiTool__jqoAU\"><div class=\"ai-tool_aiTool_header__6jVmq\"><div><h2 class=\"ai-tool_t2__2y4F_\">Magical AI Tool to visualize your Imagined stories Instantly</h2><p class=\"d16-black\">Draw your adventure from words to game, and play the game with unlimietd freedom</p></div><a href=\"https://developer.rpggo.ai/rpggo-creator-tutorial\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"ai-tool_button__EH4sB\">Creator Tutorial </div></a></div><div class=\"ai-tool_toolDes__nfMJb\"><div class=\"ai-tool_tool_item__X4RH2\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/code.png\" alt=\"\"/><p class=\"ai-tool_title__39I7r\">No-Code Creation With Copilot</p><p class=\"ai-tool_des1__P7ZzP\">Craft AI RPG games effortlessly , eliminating the need for prompts and codes. Converts natural language into interactive game mechanics.</p><p class=\"ai-tool_des2__Tv6iF\">Automatically fill in the necessary fields with AI.</p></div><div class=\"ai-tool_tool_item__X4RH2\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/endings.png\" alt=\"\"/><p class=\"ai-tool_title__39I7r\">Diverse Story-lines</p><p class=\"ai-tool_des1__P7ZzP\">Expand your imagined narrative into an RPG with diverse story-lines.</p><p class=\"ai-tool_des2__Tv6iF\">Powered by AI engine, break your descriptions down into granular tasks and branching triggers.</p></div><div class=\"ai-tool_tool_item__X4RH2\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/rpggo_images/creator-tool/aboutus/Copilot.png\" alt=\"\"/><p class=\"ai-tool_title__39I7r\">Real-time In-game Visual/Audio</p><p class=\"ai-tool_des1__P7ZzP\">Regardless of your skills in art and audio designs, your game with have visual and NPC voice expressions powered by the AI engine automatically.</p><p class=\"ai-tool_des2__Tv6iF\">Real-time, multi-modal, and more.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"open-worlds_greyBorder2__828sG\"></div><div class=\"game-engine_gameEngine__Vzw1a\"><div class=\"game-engine_gameEngine_header__aOrd5\"><h1 class=\"t1\">Powered by<br/>AI Game Engine</h1><div class=\"game-engine_gameEngine_des__X0LLx\">Unleash your creativity on designing games through natural language. Craft truly dynamic narratives where anything can happen.</div><a href=\"https://developer.rpggo.ai/dev-docs/introduction/getting-started\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"game-engine_button__e_8j8\">learn more</div></a></div><div class=\"game-engine_row__IGhjw\"><div class=\"game-engine_row_item__utVVC\"><div class=\"game-engine_title__dmuUn\">AI enhances the gaming experience</div><ul class=\"game-engine_ul__ditrP\"><li>Intelligent AI NPCs with an advanced memory system</li><li>Dynamic narratives generated by a sophisticated AI agent system</li><li>Personalized gameplay experience</li><li>High-speed visual rendering using multi-modal models</li></ul></div><div class=\"game-engine_row_item__utVVC\"><div class=\"game-engine_title__dmuUn\">Leading AI Technologies for Game</div><ul class=\"game-engine_ul__ditrP\"><li>Fine-tuning AI for game development across diverse genres</li><li>Specialized datasets &amp; labeling techniques for game</li><li>Architecture for LLM-augmented autonomous agents</li><li>AI system tailored for game design and structure</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"game-engine_flow__p3_nd\"></div></div><div class=\"game-engine_yellowBorder2__bmOhJ\"></div></main><footer class=\"f